WEBVTT

00:01:54.880 --> 00:01:57.580
You want heart, little one?

00:02:21.690 --> 00:02:22.240
Noir?

00:02:23.320 --> 00:02:26.250
I am okay. Let us go, Roda.

00:02:27.070 --> 00:02:27.960
As you wish.

00:02:38.470 --> 00:02:39.630
That's...!

00:02:45.270 --> 00:02:46.530
Lag?

00:02:47.730 --> 00:02:48.970
Where am I?

00:02:49.050 --> 00:02:55.510
Veritably Abbey

00:02:49.560 --> 00:02:51.390
The City of Pierce.

00:02:52.310 --> 00:02:56.190
On my way back to the Hive, I heard that 
a Bee had collapsed and been carried here.

00:02:57.790 --> 00:02:59.930
What in the world happened, Zazie?

00:03:01.620 --> 00:03:04.490
I had my letters stolen...by Noir...

00:03:05.060 --> 00:03:07.740
Gauche? You met Gauche?

00:03:08.760 --> 00:03:09.790
Yeah.

00:03:14.340 --> 00:03:17.670
And I saw a gaichuu in Noir's memories.

00:03:18.350 --> 00:03:21.710
The gaichuu molted and flew off into the sky.

00:03:22.200 --> 00:03:24.080
Never seen one like that before.

00:03:24.080 --> 00:03:28.780
That gaichuu came out of a cave 
where it was frozen in ice.

00:03:30.540 --> 00:03:32.830
What exactly are those creatures?

00:03:32.830 --> 00:03:37.420
They begin to metamorphose after 
they shed that last bit of heart.

00:03:37.670 --> 00:03:40.740
The Maka, in order to prevent the 
world order from falling into chaos,

00:03:40.740 --> 00:03:43.620
froze them before their 
metamorphosis was carried out,

00:03:43.620 --> 00:03:45.320
and trapped them here in this land.

00:03:45.700 --> 00:03:51.560
They are the ultimate form of the Spirit 
Insects, the same as the one dwelling in your eye.

00:03:54.750 --> 00:03:56.560
In ancient times,

00:03:56.560 --> 00:04:00.350
Spirit Insects were chosen creatures,

00:04:00.350 --> 00:04:04.770
born from the fusion of small insects with 
spirit energy beings of the great land.

00:04:05.050 --> 00:04:10.380
But after their lives end, and the last 
bit of heart sheds from their bodies,

00:04:10.380 --> 00:04:13.600
they metamorphose into a completely 
different type of creature.

00:04:14.620 --> 00:04:16.720
Into the creatures known as gaichuu;

00:04:16.720 --> 00:04:20.730
empty, pitiful vessels that know nothing 
but searching for their lost heart.

00:04:21.610 --> 00:04:23.680
Gaichuu?

00:04:23.680 --> 00:04:27.980
You mean that the sworn enemy of 
the Letter Bees is inside my body?

00:04:27.980 --> 00:04:33.860
Wait... Does that mean that the Spirit Insect 
inside of me will turn into a gaichuu one day?

00:04:33.860 --> 00:04:36.110
And all the other Spirit 
Insects the Bees carry?

00:04:36.110 --> 00:04:40.130
One might say that if they turn into amber 
before losing the last bit of heart,

00:04:40.130 --> 00:04:42.930
most never undergo the 
transformation to gaichuu.

00:04:43.530 --> 00:04:45.720
Thank goodness...

00:04:46.580 --> 00:04:50.680
The Spirit Amber in my eye 
was given to me by my mother,

00:04:51.250 --> 00:04:54.990
in order to cure an illness 
I had after I was born.

00:04:54.990 --> 00:04:59.600
In other words, I'm alive today 
because of the power from this stone.

00:04:59.600 --> 00:05:03.570
The precious eye my mother 
gave me is always with me.

00:05:03.990 --> 00:05:08.840
If the Spirit that saved my life 
shed its heart and became a gaichuu,

00:05:08.840 --> 00:05:11.660
how terribly sad that would be...

00:05:13.830 --> 00:05:18.820
That Spirit Insect still saves 
you today as you live together.

00:05:19.250 --> 00:05:20.880
You had a good mother.

00:05:21.970 --> 00:05:23.000
Thank you...

00:05:24.510 --> 00:05:31.010
But if all those sleeping here, who did 
not turn to amber, awaken as gaichuu,

00:05:31.750 --> 00:05:35.100
the world will surely fall into 
great peril and confusion.

00:05:37.560 --> 00:05:39.200
Oh, right... Gauche!

00:05:39.200 --> 00:05:43.250
Was there a man dressed in 
black who came to the cave?

00:05:43.570 --> 00:05:44.150
Yes.

00:05:44.540 --> 00:05:46.520
What was he doing?

00:05:46.790 --> 00:05:50.220
He awakened a single larva 
and brought it away with him.

00:05:50.780 --> 00:05:53.470
And you didn't stop him?

00:05:53.470 --> 00:05:55.950
A single one by itself is insignificant.

00:05:56.520 --> 00:06:00.680
After all, there are many thousands 
of Spirit Insects sleeping here.

00:06:01.320 --> 00:06:03.430
That many?

00:06:03.430 --> 00:06:07.330
The Maka calls this place 
the Garden of Spirits.

00:06:07.330 --> 00:06:09.890
Garden of Spirits?

00:06:13.500 --> 00:06:17.560
To think it's actually the insects in 
Spirit Amber that become gaichuu...

00:06:17.560 --> 00:06:23.400
The real problem is that gaichuu 
Noir woke up. Where'd it fly off to?

00:06:24.180 --> 00:06:29.160
And the letters they've been stealing 
seem to have some connection.

00:06:29.850 --> 00:06:30.910
Zazie.

00:06:31.900 --> 00:06:35.470
We really don't know anything 
about this country, do we?

00:06:35.760 --> 00:06:40.620
The Amberground government we work 
for... What the capital is like...

00:06:40.620 --> 00:06:43.700
We aren't allowed to know 
the truth about anything.

00:06:45.630 --> 00:06:49.320
Well of course it's annoying when 
you got questions you want answered!

00:06:51.630 --> 00:06:54.220
Anyway, I'm worried about 
Connor and his letters.

00:06:55.010 --> 00:06:56.190
Let's go, Lag!

00:06:56.480 --> 00:06:57.190
Yeah!

00:06:59.340 --> 00:07:04.450
Anyway, Lag... Did you finish the letter 
to Noir to pack inside the Letter Bullet?

00:07:04.450 --> 00:07:07.730
Yup! The day before yesterday, 
before I got to the city of Pierce.

00:07:07.980 --> 00:07:10.610
Great! All you need to do is 
blast that into Noir, and...

00:07:11.970 --> 00:07:14.180
But, I can't be sure...

00:07:14.180 --> 00:07:17.640
Will my letter really 
be able to reach Gauche?

00:07:17.640 --> 00:07:18.800
It'll reach 'im.

00:07:19.750 --> 00:07:26.330
And if it don't, I'll pump him full of my 
shindans of malice and beat him down good!

00:07:26.330 --> 00:07:29.770
I gotta pay him back big 
time for what he did to me!

00:07:29.770 --> 00:07:30.760
Zazie...

00:07:33.960 --> 00:07:35.640
It's a Miss Mascara Lizard.

00:07:36.020 --> 00:07:40.980
But this route doesn't have any gaichuu 
points... It's a very safe path.

00:07:40.980 --> 00:07:44.740
If it's drawn by one of those 
slow, wild Mascara Lizards,

00:07:44.740 --> 00:07:47.230
it has to be some important cargo.

00:07:49.540 --> 00:07:52.320
There it is! The Town of Lament.

00:07:52.320 --> 00:07:54.910
That's where Connor should 
be doing his deliveries.

00:08:02.620 --> 00:08:05.400
Lag, there he is! He's collapsed!

00:08:05.790 --> 00:08:08.720
Connor, what's the matter? Wake up!

00:08:08.720 --> 00:08:11.680
Were you attacked by Noir? 
What about the letters?

00:08:11.940 --> 00:08:15.600
La...g... Za...zie...

00:08:15.600 --> 00:08:18.490
Thank goodness! You know who we are, right?

00:08:18.490 --> 00:08:19.890
Hang in there, Connor!

00:08:20.140 --> 00:08:21.570
Here, eat an apple!

00:08:23.660 --> 00:08:24.640
Don't wanna...

00:08:29.000 --> 00:08:32.900
No... Connor's heart is dead!

00:08:33.880 --> 00:08:35.170
Zazie...

00:08:36.930 --> 00:08:40.160
Lend me money. I need it to buy cookies.

00:08:41.420 --> 00:08:43.720
What's this pile of wrappers?

00:08:44.470 --> 00:08:46.410
Cloister cookies?

00:08:46.960 --> 00:08:48.880
You ate all of them?

00:08:48.880 --> 00:08:52.060
Yeah... That's why I'm so full.

00:08:53.290 --> 00:08:55.770
I'll eat that apple later.

00:08:58.340 --> 00:09:00.160
Actually, maybe I'll go ahead and eat it now.

00:09:00.160 --> 00:09:00.810
That was fast!

00:09:03.720 --> 00:09:06.120
You like one of the nuns?

00:09:06.120 --> 00:09:06.980
Yeah...

00:09:09.000 --> 00:09:12.160
Veritably Abbey. Here!

00:09:12.160 --> 00:09:15.110
Excuse me! I'd like some cookies!

00:09:15.110 --> 00:09:19.030
Hello. We have butter, cinamon, 
and coffee cookies...

00:09:19.030 --> 00:09:20.800
I'd like 3 bags of each!

00:09:21.310 --> 00:09:23.100
That will be 1800 rin.

00:09:23.810 --> 00:09:25.580
Here! And keep the change.

00:09:25.830 --> 00:09:27.550
You're a Bee?

00:09:27.550 --> 00:09:29.950
Yes! I'm here to pickup letters.

00:09:29.950 --> 00:09:32.330
If you have any letters, I'll take them.

00:09:32.760 --> 00:09:34.400
We don't have any right now.

00:09:35.070 --> 00:09:35.970
Here.

00:09:37.280 --> 00:09:38.970
Thank you, Bee.

00:09:39.360 --> 00:09:42.810
Enjoy the sweet flavor of 
the cookies of this abbey.

00:09:48.620 --> 00:09:55.010
So then you bought cookies from the Abbey 
every day because you wanted to see her?

00:09:55.010 --> 00:09:55.840
Yeah.

00:09:55.840 --> 00:09:59.020
That is <i>so</i> lame! Serves me 
right, worrying about you!

00:09:59.270 --> 00:10:03.000
But the only time I met that 
pretty girl was the first time.

00:10:03.000 --> 00:10:07.690
After that it's always been a little 
redheaded girl that looks like a matryoshka.

00:10:07.690 --> 00:10:09.440
Matryoshka?

00:10:09.440 --> 00:10:12.670
Oh, Mr. Connor! You've come again?

00:10:12.670 --> 00:10:14.440
Hey, Sunny...

00:10:14.440 --> 00:10:16.420
This is already the third 
time today you know.

00:10:16.670 --> 00:10:18.930
Is that girl around?

00:10:19.180 --> 00:10:23.770
No matter how many times you ask, 
she only sold cookies that one time.

00:10:23.770 --> 00:10:26.900
I am the one who is in charge of 
making the cookies, you see...

00:10:27.820 --> 00:10:28.890
How many?

00:10:28.890 --> 00:10:30.340
Three bags!

00:10:30.340 --> 00:10:31.620
Zazie, pay up.

00:10:31.620 --> 00:10:32.900
You're gonna eat <i>more</i>?

00:10:33.520 --> 00:10:34.570
Please...

00:10:35.270 --> 00:10:39.130
I know they're just baked, but...

00:10:41.610 --> 00:10:44.170
But good food is yummy!

00:10:44.170 --> 00:10:45.430
Uh, duh.

00:10:46.600 --> 00:10:47.750
Um...

00:10:48.160 --> 00:10:52.810
You can't call that girl to come?

00:10:52.810 --> 00:10:57.290
There are strict rules here in this 
abbey that worships the Empress.

00:10:57.290 --> 00:11:01.010
Actually us speaking like 
this is not allowed either.

00:11:01.010 --> 00:11:04.020
Even giving one's name is forbidden.

00:11:04.020 --> 00:11:06.690
Oh, really? Even you, Sunny?

00:11:06.690 --> 00:11:12.540
Since you've been coming the past few 
days all the time, I just kind of...

00:11:12.540 --> 00:11:15.180
That's enough Connor. Give her up already.

00:11:15.460 --> 00:11:17.630
We don't have time for this now.

00:11:17.630 --> 00:11:18.690
Um...

00:11:19.810 --> 00:11:25.350
What are three of you Bees doing 
here in the town of Lament?

00:11:25.350 --> 00:11:27.630
We just happened to cross paths is all.

00:11:27.630 --> 00:11:29.530
We're heading back to Yuusari now.

00:11:30.630 --> 00:11:32.630
You're also going to Yuusari, Mr. Connor?

00:11:32.870 --> 00:11:35.570
I am planning on staying here one more day.

00:11:35.570 --> 00:11:36.700
What?!

00:11:36.700 --> 00:11:40.940
Then I'll make sure to bake 
lots of cookies for tomorrow!

00:11:43.510 --> 00:11:46.880
That girl... Could she have... ...for Connor?

00:11:49.850 --> 00:11:51.060
That's the lizard from earlier.

00:11:51.310 --> 00:11:53.690
Thank you. Hurry and bring them inside.

00:11:55.830 --> 00:11:56.400
Roda!

00:11:57.340 --> 00:11:58.370
What're you lookin' at?

00:11:58.370 --> 00:12:00.030
Zaziahhh!

00:12:02.240 --> 00:12:03.900
Don't push me, man...

00:12:04.900 --> 00:12:07.340
That Abbey is a Reverse base?

00:12:07.680 --> 00:12:11.430
It does seem like they have places 
to hide out here and there...

00:12:11.430 --> 00:12:17.060
It's got to be! And the white girl that 
Connor fell for... It has to be...

00:12:17.670 --> 00:12:19.890
Whoa there! Where do you think you're going?

00:12:19.890 --> 00:12:23.140
I'm going to pretend to be a 
traveler and infiltrate the abbey!

00:12:23.140 --> 00:12:24.440
Say what?!

00:12:24.440 --> 00:12:28.430
Reverse is trying to do something 
in this town! I have to find out!

00:12:28.960 --> 00:12:32.480
And if Roda is here, then 
Gauch is sure to appear!

00:12:32.480 --> 00:12:37.250
Okay! Zazie, return to the Hive, and 
get the Master's marching orders!

00:12:39.360 --> 00:12:43.380
He sure gets all macho 
whenever it comes to Gauche.

00:12:43.380 --> 00:12:45.440
And how are you gonna infiltrate it, anyway?

00:12:45.710 --> 00:12:49.170
That's a cloister! Men are forbidden!

00:12:53.370 --> 00:12:55.370
Yes? Who are you?

00:12:55.370 --> 00:12:57.860
E-Excuse me... I'm...

00:12:57.860 --> 00:12:59.390
Um, I'm a boy, er...

00:12:59.390 --> 00:13:04.840
a girl on a pilgrimage visiting churches and 
sanctuaries, selling fuel stones as I go.

00:13:04.840 --> 00:13:07.370
Today, I don't have any 
place to stay the night...

00:13:07.370 --> 00:13:12.550
Oh, my! To think a girl my age is going 
on a pilgrimage throughout Yodaka...

00:13:12.550 --> 00:13:13.680
How admirable!

00:13:14.220 --> 00:13:17.630
Now, come inside. I will see what 
accommodations I can get you.

00:13:18.030 --> 00:13:19.470
Thank you very much.

00:13:19.470 --> 00:13:25.710
Dang... Lag got in without raising 
even the least bit of suspicion...

00:13:26.350 --> 00:13:28.360
It totally works on him for some reason.

00:13:29.970 --> 00:13:32.710
I'm Sunny. Who are you?

00:13:33.660 --> 00:13:36.010
La... Uh... La...

00:13:36.010 --> 00:13:37.450
I'm Lala!

00:13:37.810 --> 00:13:38.990
Lala-chan...

00:13:39.900 --> 00:13:46.550
I'm sorry. It's time for an important 
prayer. Will you wait here for me?

00:13:47.370 --> 00:13:48.230
Sure.

00:13:48.230 --> 00:13:51.130
We'll search for an open bed when I get back.

00:13:52.370 --> 00:13:56.190
Is such a kind girl like that 
really a member of reverse?

00:13:57.430 --> 00:14:01.030
I don't have time to think about it. 
This is my chance to investigate!

00:14:01.890 --> 00:14:02.860
I have to hurry!

00:14:05.120 --> 00:14:06.690
How far is she going?

00:14:07.250 --> 00:14:10.990
And I'm really feeling a bit breezy here...

00:14:11.400 --> 00:14:13.620
I am sorry for being tardy.

00:14:14.800 --> 00:14:15.870
Lookouts?

00:14:20.140 --> 00:14:22.290
This many people?

00:14:24.420 --> 00:14:25.550
Roda!

00:14:26.240 --> 00:14:29.170
The final letters have been 
delivered to the town.

00:14:29.850 --> 00:14:32.980
If the human sacrifice here in 
the town of Lament is a success,

00:14:32.980 --> 00:14:38.840
neither the government nor the Bees will be 
able to stop our plans any longer! Reverse's plans!

00:14:38.840 --> 00:14:41.740
The human sacrifices will become the 
pillars that will save the world.

00:14:41.740 --> 00:14:46.770
They will save the world whose heart has 
been stolen by the government in the capital!

00:14:46.770 --> 00:14:49.640
You will sacrifice yourselves 
to save this world.

00:14:50.180 --> 00:14:52.690
We will revolutionize Amberground!

00:14:52.690 --> 00:14:54.600
We are Reverse!

00:14:54.600 --> 00:14:56.730
We are Reverse!

00:14:56.730 --> 00:14:59.760
Return everything back to the proper order!

00:14:59.760 --> 00:15:02.760
Reverse! Reverse! Reverse!

00:15:02.760 --> 00:15:03.970
Sunny...

00:15:04.720 --> 00:15:07.320
Human sacrifices will save the world?

00:15:07.620 --> 00:15:09.650
What is she talking about?

00:15:10.630 --> 00:15:13.460
Hey, listen to me Connor, would you?

00:15:13.460 --> 00:15:17.040
That Abbey is a hideout for Reverse...

00:15:16.330 --> 00:15:18.060
That can't be!

00:15:18.380 --> 00:15:22.950
I've gone there every day to buy cookies, 
and I've never seen anything suspicious!

00:15:23.660 --> 00:15:31.990
And besides, a girl as pretty and nice as 
her could never do things like steal letters!

00:15:32.260 --> 00:15:35.690
They believe what they are 
doing is right, you know!

00:15:35.690 --> 00:15:37.100
Are you an idiot?

00:15:37.490 --> 00:15:40.300
I'm going back to report to the Hive.

00:15:40.300 --> 00:15:43.140
You keep a lookout on the Abbey, got it?

00:15:43.560 --> 00:15:44.700
What about Lag?

00:15:44.700 --> 00:15:45.660
Lag?

00:15:47.580 --> 00:15:50.380
"I wanna dress up like a 
girl and infiltrate too!"

00:15:50.380 --> 00:15:51.840
Yeah, he'd totally say that.

00:15:52.610 --> 00:15:55.010
Lag is staking out a different place.

00:15:55.010 --> 00:15:55.980
See ya!

00:15:57.150 --> 00:15:59.550
Right now, Lag doesn't have Niche with him.

00:15:59.550 --> 00:16:03.190
If something goes wrong, you're 
the only one he has, Connor!

00:16:03.190 --> 00:16:04.390
We're counting on you!

00:16:10.020 --> 00:16:11.850
Where is everyone going?

00:16:20.280 --> 00:16:24.810
I have to find out what Reverse is doing 
in the capital and in the government!

00:16:24.810 --> 00:16:25.980
What their plans are!

00:16:27.800 --> 00:16:28.670
You there.

00:16:32.940 --> 00:16:35.800
This hallway is undergoing 
restoration. You may not pass here.

00:16:36.180 --> 00:16:37.970
I have never seen your face here before.

00:16:37.970 --> 00:16:40.240
I-I'm a traveler.

00:16:40.240 --> 00:16:44.010
I was planning on staying the night here,

00:16:44.010 --> 00:16:46.140
but I've gotten separated from Sunny-san...

00:16:46.540 --> 00:16:48.490
I'll just go search over there, then...

00:16:51.410 --> 00:16:54.360
Pretty. Your hair is silver colored?

00:16:55.600 --> 00:16:56.660
Yes.

00:16:56.980 --> 00:16:58.990
Perhaps your eye is amber colored, as well?

00:17:00.260 --> 00:17:01.150
Yes...

00:17:01.920 --> 00:17:03.510
So cute...

00:17:08.470 --> 00:17:10.750
You cannot resist.

00:17:14.690 --> 00:17:18.970
Letters Bees save nothing, Lag Seeing.

00:17:28.500 --> 00:17:31.190
I will not allow you to interfere.

00:17:31.750 --> 00:17:34.360
Roda, what is it you plan on doing?

00:17:35.750 --> 00:17:39.440
And I ask you... What are 
you doing dressed like that?

00:17:40.490 --> 00:17:41.860
Well, this is...

00:17:41.860 --> 00:17:44.110
I can see straight up your skirt, you know.

00:17:45.850 --> 00:17:47.540
What am I...

00:17:51.500 --> 00:17:53.490
Lag Rocket!

00:17:55.510 --> 00:17:58.330
My shindanjuu is over there!

00:18:04.400 --> 00:18:06.410
You really are cute.

00:18:06.780 --> 00:18:09.390
A naive, ignorant worker 
Bee of the government...

00:18:10.900 --> 00:18:16.750
The plan to artificially create the beings 
known as Spirits that hold great energy...

00:18:17.350 --> 00:18:21.750
In the capital, I was fused with all manner 
of different creatures by the government.

00:18:22.210 --> 00:18:26.330
Failures like me were branded, disposed of,

00:18:26.880 --> 00:18:28.910
and I have no memories of before I was fused.

00:18:30.900 --> 00:18:31.750
That was..

00:18:32.790 --> 00:18:37.770
I don't even know what living 
thing's heart I have within me.

00:18:40.610 --> 00:18:45.830
The capital, Akatsuki, prospers by 
consuming the pitiful hearts of others.

00:18:49.640 --> 00:18:52.150
But that will all end soon.

00:18:58.500 --> 00:19:01.110
It will consume everything in the capital!

00:19:01.360 --> 00:19:02.610
It?

00:19:13.820 --> 00:19:18.460
What in the world is Reverse plotting to do?

00:19:25.900 --> 00:19:41.390
Next: Cabernet Attacks
